<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 216 FOR TWO AT TEA V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 216 FOR TWO AT TEA V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies, chasing Australia's first innings 243 all out, were 216 for two at tea on the second day of the fifth and final test at the WACA Ground on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 243 all out (Michael Bevan 87 not out, Mark Waugh 79, Curtly Ambrose five for 43); West Indies 216 for two (Brian Lara 103 not out)</p>
